DESCRIPTION:You're Invited!\n\n\nGarden Party & Silent Auction\n\n\nJoin 
 us for an afternoon of beautiful gardens\, great company\, and exciting a
 uction items at our Garden Party & Silent Auction.\n\n\n📅 Saturday\, Jun
 e 27\n🕞 3:30 PM – 5:30 PM\n📍 100 6th Street\, Petaluma\, CA\n\n\nHosted
  by the Petaluma Woman's Club Foundation\, this special event brings our 
 community together to support local students and celebrate the spirit of 
 giving.\nStroll through the garden\, enjoy refreshments\, connect with fr
 iends and neighbors\, and bid on an array of unique items\, experiences\,
  and gift packages in our silent auction.\n\n\nScan the QR code or go to 
 http://petalumawomansclub.com for tickets\nAll proceeds will benefit scho
 larships for local high school graduates\, helping students pursue higher
  education and achieve their future goals.\n\n\nEvent Highlights\n• Garde
 n-inspired refreshments and appetizers\n• Silent auction featuring unique
  items and experiences\n• Music and fellowship\n• Support scholarships fo
 r local students\n\n\nWe look forward to celebrating with you and making 
 a difference in the lives of local students.\n\n\nPetaluma Woman's Club F
 oundation
