DESCRIPTION:This workshop covers both MLA and APA style and will show you 
 how to use this powerful application (FREE for SRJC students!) to build co
 rrect citations\, format your bibliographies\, and use the integration fea
 tures with SRJC Research databases. This application also offers outlining
 \, and paper-writing features\, including the capability to create papers 
 via Google Docs.To learn more and register for the Zoom\, click here. (htt
 ps://santarosa.libcal.com/calendar/workshops)
