 yle and will show you how to use this powerful application (FREE for SRJC 
 students!) to build correct citations\, format your bibliographies\, and u
 se the integration features with SRJC Research databases. This application
  also offers outlining\, and paper-writing features\, including the capabi
 lity to create papers via Google Docs.</p><p><a href="https://santarosa.li
 bcal.com/calendar/workshops" target="_blank" rel="noopener">To learn more 
