SUMMARY: Botox\, Chemical Peels & More - Aesthetic Event at Devereux Beau
 ty
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exclusive aesthetic event featuring Rachel Yus
 sim\, a registered nurse with over 14 years of experience. This event off
 ers a comprehensive menu of premium aesthetic treatments in a convenient\
 , professional setting.\n\nDate: Friday\, August 21st\, 2026\nTime: 10:00
  AM - 12:00 PM\nLocation: Devereux Beauty\, 350 2nd St Suite B\, Petaluma
 \, CA 94952\n\nAvailable Treatments:\n\n  * Botox and Xeomin injections\n
   * VI Peel Original\n  * VI Peel Original with PDRN post-procedure serum
 \n  * VI Peel Precision Plus Peptides\n  * Microneedling with PDRN (face)
 \n  * Dermal filler treatments\n  * Regenerate and Glow: PDRN booster wit
 h 3.5% Hyaluronic Acid and Glutathione\n\nWhether you're looking to refre
